          "title": "linkity-link",
          "subtitle": "A cool, simple and minimalist way to publish interesting links on the web.",
          "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0;    ; font-family: IBM Plex Sans, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 1.5 !important; color: #111111 !important; text-align: left !important\">Another, other friend of the Laboratory, Brad Barrish shared this repo he created (with Claude) that is makes is super simple to publish links onto a lightweight miniature web page. Like a personal link blog without the 💩 of the enshittifier vibe.</p>",
